# Documentation is kept on the maintainer's machine only: every Markdown file is
# private except the root README. The tests and check-docs skip the documentation
# checks when it is absent, so a public clone still passes `pnpm test`.
*.md
!/README.md
# NOT documentation: the orchestrator's system prompt is read by the code at runtime.
# Ignoring it would break the orchestrator in every clone.
!/packages/ops-orchestrator/src/prompts/system.md

